Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Twenty-Sixth Episode\NThe Icicle Queen\NSnow Queen
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.59,0:02:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Copperland...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.31,0:02:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon, every country in the world will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.32,0:02:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, the next country to take is...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.14,0:02:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Silverland.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.17,0:02:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Freeze?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.86,0:02:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Silverland is a beautiful country.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.92,0:02:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always wanted it for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.42,0:02:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I hear that country has a formidable princess named Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.83,0:02:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.58,0:02:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,First, invite the girl to Coolland.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.36,0:02:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Invite Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.04,0:02:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And what then?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.71,0:02:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,While she's away, we'll have the King and Queen...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.24,0:02:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,tied up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.75,0:03:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Conveniently enough, Silverland has wicked men like Duralumin and his cohort.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.27,0:03:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Grace. Not a soul in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.23,0:03:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I'm sure it was right around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.64,0:03:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, Lord Duralumin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.76,0:03:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.03,0:03:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you figured out a way to dispose of the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.35,0:03:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,King and Queen without anyone knowing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.17,0:03:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it true you'll step aside once that's done?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.46,0:03:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Her Majesty's word is absolute.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.17,0:03:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then leave the King and Queen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.24,0:03:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.98,0:03:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You agreed so easily. We're using Mephisto, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.62,0:04:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We're using Sapphire's boy's heart as bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.42,0:04:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.86,0:04:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall be on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.78,0:04:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure she'll be alright on her own?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.17,0:04:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.20,0:04:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The one who summoned her is no ordinary person—it's Queen Icicle of Coolland.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.17,0:04:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But rumors say she's a cold-hearted woman known as the Snow Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.56,0:04:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.07,0:04:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.31,0:04:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.08,0:04:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,To a northern country called Coolland.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.19,0:04:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmm, I wanna go too! — It's really cold, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.12,0:04:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care if it's cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.49,0:04:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Take me with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.28,0:04:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All right then, let's go together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.19,0:05:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay, I'm so happy! Come on, let's hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.96,0:05:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Giddy-up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.10,0:05:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,How lucky that Tink is leaving on his own before we even have to make a move.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.59,0:05:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost at the border. It sure is vast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.73,0:05:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That queen must be really greedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.07,0:05:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't talk bad about her, Tink.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.30,0:06:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.04,0:06:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you come here knowing this is the border of Coolland?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.28,0:06:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.15,0:06:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Sapphire of Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.05,0:06:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.24,0:06:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The escort for Princess Sapphire has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.48,0:06:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.98,0:06:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a convenient border.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.68,0:06:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Sapphire, I've come to escort you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.69,0:06:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Please get into the carriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.69,0:06:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No thanks, I have Opal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.43,0:06:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,With all due respect, a cheap horse like that is unfit for a princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.85,0:06:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You call this cheap?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.88,0:06:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Or are you saying you don't like the golden carriage sent by our Queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.02,0:06:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The Queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.31,0:06:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,As a princess of Silverland, you must behave yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.64,0:07:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, fine! I'll get in!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.86,0:07:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, could you go back without me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.64,0:07:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, come on, get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.78,0:07:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.92,0:07:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.84,0:07:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.86,0:07:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm telling him to get on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.24,0:07:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,My master is the Queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.19,0:07:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.56,0:07:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm that Queen's guest!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.91,0:07:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.75,0:07:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink is my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.20,0:07:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I get off?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.61,0:07:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't pay any attention to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.60,0:07:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.01,0:07:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Be my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.44,0:07:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.73,0:07:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to leave, go right ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.56,0:07:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, it's a horseless carriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.50,0:07:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,A horseless carriage?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.07,0:07:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How to operate it is up to the rider.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.59,0:07:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,In our country, anyone but a complete bumpkin knows how to drive one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.18,0:07:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, do you know how?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.42,0:07:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope, not a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.11,0:07:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me give it a try anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.73,0:07:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't take it so lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.12,0:08:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, horseless carriages are amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.13,0:08:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It moves just by thinking about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.17,0:08:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't just admire it—hurry up and stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.67,0:08:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't know how to stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.64,0:08:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.66,0:08:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, it all looks so desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.56,0:08:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's the aftermath of war.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.12,0:08:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This is where this country fought Coolland.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.36,0:08:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The king must have died.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.81,0:08:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I just feel that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.44,0:08:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Strange. Is no one living here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.40,0:08:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost at the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.85,0:08:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll get to see the lively parts of Coorland.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.18,0:09:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, it's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.75,0:09:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Big houses everywhere you look.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.82,0:09:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, don't get distracted!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.58,0:09:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Forward, forward, forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.81,0:09:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, it's locked!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.12,0:09:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, lower the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.57,0:09:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.80,0:09:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That is standard etiquette.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.19,0:09:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, Princess Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.22,0:09:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That was pretty embarrassing, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.97,0:09:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Presenting Her Majesty the Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.41,0:10:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Icicle, Queen of this land.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.39,0:10:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for inviting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.99,0:10:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Sapphire of Silverland.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.78,0:10:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just as lively as they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.06,0:10:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for ruining your important meeting place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.89,0:10:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, my kingdom has plenty of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.25,0:10:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, Tink, where is my friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.86,0:10:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. He's waiting outside the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.80,0:10:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.36,0:10:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.84,0:10:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you taking me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.00,0:10:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I said no! Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.77,0:11:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Get in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.38,0:11:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.76,0:11:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what you call a train.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.97,0:11:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,A train?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.31,0:11:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. An express bound for Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.73,0:11:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.56,0:11:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.42,0:11:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think of my kingdom, Lord Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.30,0:11:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think it's the grandest in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.56,0:11:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.57,0:11:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,See? Wouldn't you be happy to serve such a magnificent kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.73,0:11:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Both Copperland and Ironland fought my kingdom and suffered terribly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.55,0:11:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But I won't do that to your kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.62,0:11:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.28,0:11:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Figure that out yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.43,0:12:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're clever enough to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.79,0:12:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw what Coolland can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.59,0:12:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That hideous machine crushed Copperland!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.63,0:12:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That fireball burned Ironland to the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.30,0:12:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.43,0:12:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You're telling us to submit before we get crushed, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.84,0:12:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly. If you don't want to suffer a terrible fate, you'd better surrender quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.30,0:12:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Well? What's your answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.48,0:12:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.57,0:12:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.88,0:12:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious, Sapphire?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.72,0:12:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I absolutely refuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.06,0:12:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to destroy Silverland?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.70,0:12:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really want your beloved kingdom ruined?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.83,0:13:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's better than becoming your servant!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.19,0:13:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell Father and the others that Coolland is a grand city, but a terrible one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.72,0:13:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.89,0:13:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well said, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.53,0:13:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.80,0:13:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see what happens to anyone who insults Coolland.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.28,0:13:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.86,0:13:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,To Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.69,0:13:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Go and tell Duralumin...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.98,0:13:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,...that now is the time to summon Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.63,0:13:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, isn't my friend waiting in this house?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.32,0:13:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, he already headed back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.64,0:13:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He left?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.74,0:13:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He probably couldn't wait any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.31,0:13:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, if we hurry, we can easily catch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.62,0:13:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That impudent Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.77,0:13:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Freeze, are the arrangements ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.32,0:14:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, everything is taken care of. The messenger hawk should reach Duralumin any moment now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.74,0:14:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I've brought Mephisto with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.07,0:14:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard Tink was away, so I flew right over!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.05,0:14:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.47,0:14:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course. Now everything will go just as we planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.46,0:14:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You get Sapphire's male heart...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.19,0:14:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,...and you take over Silverland.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.68,0:15:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder how Sapphire is doing right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.73,0:15:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she going to be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.67,0:15:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'm sure she's fast asleep by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.98,0:15:12.63,Mephisto Spells,,0,0,0,,Zuborosha!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.70,0:15:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with this whirlwind?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.80,0:16:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.99,0:16:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.22,0:16:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You stand no chance against me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.62,0:16:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.30,0:16:18.34,Mephisto Spells,,0,0,0,,Zuborosha!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.62,0:16:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing with that... Wait, what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.67,0:16:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you so!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.06,0:16:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now stay quiet in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.20,0:16:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Be good!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.64,0:16:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Darling!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.27,0:16:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.07,0:16:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest assured.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.63,0:16:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon, I'll bring Sapphire here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.10,0:16:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Without her boy's heart, Sapphire won't...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.78,0:16:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.92,0:17:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.78,0:17:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry. It broke down just as I was about to catch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.59,0:17:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That's okay, I'll walk the rest of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.12,0:17:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.40,0:17:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The road to the border is that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.18,0:17:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you can come out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.84,0:17:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that was rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.27,0:17:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Even on Madame Freeze's orders, this isn't easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.40,0:17:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry. We need to beat him there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.14,0:18:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.32,0:18:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.10,0:18:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.53,0:18:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.56,0:18:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Give Tink back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.91,0:18:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do with Tink?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.78,0:18:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.18,0:18:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, hold on...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.12,0:18:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.38,0:18:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, we've been tricked!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.19,0:18:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.51,0:18:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Our defenses are holding up nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.61,0:19:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's march into Silverland. Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.69,0:19:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,To die like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.99,0:19:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,My eyes... My eyes are open!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.02,0:19:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.46,0:19:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My eyes hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.40,0:19:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pitch black...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.41,0:19:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't... I can't see anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.47,0:19:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,, I have to go back... to Silverland...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.00,0:19:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Is anyone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.21,0:19:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this the right way to Silverland?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.11,0:20:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.11,0:20:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not cross the border to the left!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.52,0:20:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The border... I remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.60,0:20:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're one of yesterday's guards!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.23,0:20:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.31,0:20:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,She's the princess of Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.26,0:20:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.86,0:20:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,As if we'd tolerate a filthy princess like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.02,0:20:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.26,0:20:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Like hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.54,0:20:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.92,0:20:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You're blind, yet you dare fight back?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.49,0:20:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.81,0:21:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, which way to Silverland?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.44,0:21:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Lead the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.22,0:21:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.24,0:21:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll guide you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.96,0:21:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.30,0:21:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the smell of the wind has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.56,0:21:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get to see Mother soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.13,0:21:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.17,0:21:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can manage on my own from here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.52,0:21:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.83,0:21:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,She's tough for a blind girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.18,0:21:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.71,0:21:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.57,0:22:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.41,0:22:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.37,0:22:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.12,0:22:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,"Sapphire"?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.66,0:22:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Whose voice is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.97,0:22:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be Duralumin's men, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.37,0:22:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you laughing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.54,0:22:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What's so funny?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.96,0:22:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What a lunatic!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.42,0:22:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you address the Grand Duke without his title!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.96,0:22:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the gate guards!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.46,0:22:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.22,0:22:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you recognize Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.62,0:22:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you guys talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.62,0:22:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's our line!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.26,0:22:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough out of you, lunatic!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.20,0:22:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire has already returned to the castle safe and sound!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.80,0:22:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.13,0:22:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.26,0:22:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.93,0:22:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see my father and mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.95,0:22:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you'll see that I'm Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.58,0:22:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but my father isn't here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.15,0:22:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,My mother isn't here either!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.74,0:22:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.12,0:22:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,They left the castle in my care and went on a secret journey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.02,0:22:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.62,0:22:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.20,0:22:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the real Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.38,0:23:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I recognize that voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.06,0:23:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.86,0:23:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the guy who threw me off the cliff using Tink's voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.70,0:23:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- Wait!\N- Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.76,0:23:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're the one impersonating me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.48,0:23:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did Mother go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.53,0:23:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need to answer you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.58,0:23:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll only tell you it's a distant island!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.11,0:23:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Drive that lunatic away!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.32,0:23:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Give them back!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.40,0:23:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother! Father! Give them back! Give them back!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.73,0:23:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.83,0:23:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,A fake Sapphire... The Snow Queen sure hatched a cruel scheme!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.97,0:24:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I won't give in!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.68,0:24:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I will not lose!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.34,0:24:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Someday, I'm going to overturn this entire scheme!{\i0}
